;====================================================================
; STAGE 1 PRACTICAL (demo dry-run) - DemoOnly=ON, DryRun=ON, risk 0.25%
; QSMC_AutoTrader v6.6.14
; IMPORTANT: you must also attach nadir2.ex5 to the SAME chart with
;   InpGateProfile=QSMC_GATE_PRACTICAL, otherwise the indicator uses
;   STRICT defaults and will refuse signals under 75/100 confidence.
; Load via: attach EA -> Inputs tab -> Load
;====================================================================

